4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vstELQR1PYwQ7kNvwEeWK1X&_nc_oc=Adqdoe0XetG_T5cRZlbIvRQloewn-6XQTO0hxbWbbiv2hMX5YmCp70RiFIQVYFQHVuk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3O9rvc23JJ7xjYOMWdS5aek_gmjDmGkzblodiEvckmag&oe=69DCE9D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=siFxbWuviMUQ7kNvwETNfJA&_nc_oc=AdodeLYXJeREUCHrzOXhGHrbmVcPU2555ZXM_AGdeSWyr3Xm9I06D9jwT7bT-6EJhlc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2eXMhqYtwfEEu1Wo1geQmBTaNk8AMAQagkjXUU03jJBA&oe=69DCEEB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vVQDATesY04Q7kNvwFSAVjN&_nc_oc=AdoQhIJjHpB0VY2BoiFhGZtlKzT44yERHfIoFqQtlUlk0HwbzAz8jllDgOjNY8_zKtk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1DyHs6A3ItA2ippjMFlnzf7stcNOqd7q8EX_-49WxV_w&oe=69DCFC55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p